WEBVTT

00:10:00.929 --> 00:10:04.141
The star in middle age

00:10:05.726 --> 00:10:08.479
The love that fades to black

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:12.191
Once revealed, won’t be taken back

00:10:12.566 --> 00:10:16.695
Light nothing can escape

00:10:20.282 --> 00:10:24.078
The ignorance we once forgave

00:10:26.455 --> 00:10:31.460
In the future,
if we don't decide to change